{
  "name": "Lifecycle OS",
  "short_name": "Lifecycle OS",
  "description": "Onboard a brand once and the whole suite runs as that brand — its palette, voice, catalogue, cohorts and competitive set. Analyse, plan, create, benchmark, operate and ship, with a missing fact left missing.",
